                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>alɛ.jaʔ pɘɾsit̪ɛ ɔkaʈaʔiɲ siɾiɲkɛt̪̚ʔ ɔna d̪ɔ d̪ulɘɾ ɾe.jaʔ siɾiɲ kana</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
