                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>ɟa͡o̯gʰɘɽi paɽhaʔmɛ ɛnkʰan am gɔgɔbaba d̪ɔ bʰage gid̪ɾɘkin mɛt̪ama</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
