                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>iɲ ɔka nakʰaɾɛɲ t̪ahɛ̃nkan ɔnɖɛnko ɟɔt̪ɔhɔɽko opoɾomiɲɘ</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
